      "writtenOn": "2021-01-27T19:53:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Issue occurs in multiple tests (eg. flash_write_protect, timer_dos, utils_str, pingpong, timer_calib, etc.). These tests are using normal implementation of charge manager. Should I add function to all tests separately, or to charge manager? What about value returned by this function? When added to tests it could be 0 for example.",
