      "writtenOn": "2021-01-27T21:12:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the root of the problem is that this function is defined in an #ifndef TEST_BUILD section of charge_manager. This section appears to have been created to avoid mocking out some PD functions that charge_manager uses: https://crrev.com/c/297789.\n\nI have started along the path of exposing this section in test builds, which has turned into using mocks in more tests. I think this is basically the right direction to go in, but it looks like the rabbit hole might be pretty deep.\n\nAseda: I\u0027d be interested in your thoughts on this high-level approach.",
      "revId": "794435fc6e622c26d17ce777990b5dc356cc049d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
